      "name": "Julieto Agbay",
      "created_at": "2025-10-06T09:47:05.670Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can say the Workspace is one the best feature I love with Frappe/ERPNext. Here is our use case. We set-up 3 workspace; Hourly for frequent and recurring transactions, Daily for viewing and editing Master Files and Weekly for Reports &amp; Charts. Every users has different contents. What is added in their workspaces are those only what they need for the job, no more no less. To the point where all the menu under Public we want to hide them.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/d/ad5d509ccdcb069fb538de59f8452152be9482c0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ad5d509ccdcb069fb538de59f8452152be9482c0\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ad5d509ccdcb069fb538de59f8452152be9482c0_2_690x369.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"oJEwM1GInjcbmCJoVYHDg7hUWEU\" width=\"690\" height=\"369\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ad5d509ccdcb069fb538de59f8452152be9482c0_2_690x369.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/d/ad5d509ccdcb069fb538de59f8452152be9482c0_2_1035x553.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/d/ad5d509ccdcb069fb538de59f8452152be9482c0.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"21262B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1366×732 65 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
