      "username": "peterg",
      "name": "Peter",
      "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:55:40.778Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Fully agree! Workspaces are a great intermediate between default interfaces and full bespoke applications.</p>\n<p>We’ve been making lots of mini-applications using Vue and Custom HTML blocks to help handle repetitive tasks. For petty cash expenses, for example, employees can hit a button and fill in details without having to manage a full invoice, for example. It’s been a huge boost.</p>",
